But isn't what Very Berry shows just other people's opinions?

00:30:24.230 --> 00:30:26.800
If that's the case, my opinion is just another data point.

00:30:29.170 --> 00:30:31.940
You yourself don't actually care about other people's opinions,

00:30:32.040 --> 00:30:35.510
yet you send your users on a rollercoaster of fickle opinions.

00:30:35.570 --> 00:30:37.140
How's that for a contradiction?

00:30:39.910 --> 00:30:43.480
And that is my personal assessment of Very Berry and its creator.

00:30:46.820 --> 00:30:50.050
- San! - Why didn't you answer our calls?

00:30:52.620 --> 00:30:53.860
Why didn't you pick up?

00:30:54.790 --> 00:30:56.790
- I was busy. - But you really told him off.

00:30:56.860 --> 00:31:00.030
- Right? - He was pissing me off.

00:31:07.040 --> 00:31:08.040
San.

00:31:09.310 --> 00:31:10.370
What did you want to talk about?

00:31:11.040 --> 00:31:12.040
What?

00:31:12.840 --> 00:31:15.080
You texted me, remember? You said you had something to say.

00:31:18.110 --> 00:31:19.380
It's nothing.

00:31:22.220 --> 00:31:23.220
But...

00:31:24.890 --> 00:31:26.060
it's good to see you.

00:31:30.530 --> 00:31:32.160
A self-fulfilling prophecy.

00:31:32.460 --> 00:31:37.130
When trying hard to not get involved is what creates a special bond.